      "side": 1,
      "message": "What I\u0027m saying is, you may be able to extend EC_CMD_REBOOT_EC to do the same. It allows you to make the EC take some action after shutdown. You probably need to add a new flag (e.g. EC_REBOOT_FLAG_CLEAR_AP_IDLE). I don\u0027t think you need a new command.",
